         "The Deny statement is the MFA gate: any request without MFA is denied regardless of other Allows. BoolIfExists handles service-linked calls gracefully. The S3 command enables MFA Delete — now even a compromised admin credential cannot permanently delete versioned objects without the hardware second factor.",
